#: ../../00-overview.md:1 060bb95a36564eea9e030ba3f50105d4
msgid "00. Project Overview"
msgstr "00. 项目概述"

#: ../../00-overview.md:5 281e7968d73c4113b70400bc71a16b7e
msgid ""
"FreeSWITCH is a modular softswitch: a software-defined telecom stack that "
"replaces proprietary PBX and class-5 switching hardware with a process that "
"runs on commodity servers, from a Raspberry Pi to a multi-core host. This "
"repository is the C core, loadable modules, XML configuration profiles, "
"packaging, and Event Socket tooling for that stack. Version in this tree is "
"**1.11.3-dev** (`configure.ac`). License is **MPL 1.1**. SignalWire is the "
"primary sponsor; `mod_signalwire` in this tree pairs a local switch with "
"SignalWire cloud services."
msgstr ""
"FreeSWITCH 是一套模块化软交换：用运行在通用服务器上的进程（从 Raspberry Pi 到多核主机）替代专有 PBX 和 class-5 "
"交换硬件的软件定义电信栈。本仓库是该栈的 C 核心、可加载模块、XML 配置模板、打包以及 Event Socket 工具。本树版本为 "
"**1.11.3-dev**（`configure.ac`）。许可证为 **MPL 1.1**。SignalWire 是主要赞助方；本树中的 "
"`mod_signalwire` 将本地交换机与 SignalWire 云服务对接。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:7 a02ed8c281c847e08476c9adf2ea5c56
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../00-overview.md:9 2bcdfd3c376044ed8c50143fae99c6a5
msgid ""
"Switch, bridge, and transcode real-time voice, video, and messaging "
"sessions."
msgstr "交换、桥接并转码实时语音、视频和消息会话。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:10 000fd6db11204076aa86c6cf7ed4c5eb
msgid ""
"Expose a loadable-module API so SIP, WebRTC, codecs, dialplans, languages, "
"and CDR backends can be added without forking the core."
msgstr "提供可加载模块 API，以便在无需 fork 核心的情况下增加 SIP、WebRTC、编解码器、拨号计划、语言和 CDR 后端。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:11 7365b242d9dd41a4ba24f39f3800b346
msgid ""
"Provide a working default PBX configuration (`conf/vanilla`) so operators "
"can start testing immediately."
msgstr "提供可用的默认 PBX 配置（`conf/vanilla`），方便运维人员立即开始测试。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:12 18becaeb8bdf46739cb8243f2bd7bb6b
msgid ""
"Offer an out-of-process control plane (Event Socket / ESL) so applications "
"can originate, hang up, and subscribe to events without embedding in the "
"media process."
msgstr "提供进程外控制面（Event Socket / ESL），使应用可以发起呼叫、挂断并订阅事件，而无需嵌入媒体进程。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:14 fe3dab036c40439387e4fba34fe6b338
msgid ""
"This PKB documents **this source tree**. Operator configuration — XML, "
"directory, SIP profiles, dialplan, codecs, applications, WebRTC, ESL — lives"
" in the [FreeSWITCH Users "
"Manual](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/). Every parameter table"
" there is verified against FreeSWITCH source and the shipped vanilla config."
" Older wiki pages remain on [FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/) and [Confluence](https://freeswitch.org/confluence/)."
msgstr ""
"本 PKB 记录的是**本源码树**。运维配置（XML、号码簿、SIP profiles、拨号计划、编解码、应用、WebRTC、ESL）在 "
"[FreeSWITCH 用户手册](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/)。手册中的参数表均对照 "
"FreeSWITCH 源码与随附 vanilla 配置核实。旧 wiki 仍在 [FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/) 与 [Confluence](https://freeswitch.org/confluence/)。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:16 4ea31ac979e7499fbe9927242c46fda1
msgid ""
"The Users Manual applies to both **Open Source FreeSWITCH** (this tree and "
"[release builds](https://files.freeswitch.org/releases/freeswitch/)) and "
"**FreeSWITCH Enterprise** (commercially supported SignalWire builds). Hosted"
" SignalWire cloud is still a separate product."
msgstr ""
"用户手册同时适用于 **开源 "
"FreeSWITCH**（本仓库与[发行构建](https://files.freeswitch.org/releases/freeswitch/)）和"
" **FreeSWITCH Enterprise**（SignalWire 商业支持构建）。托管的 SignalWire 云仍是独立产品。"

