#: ../../00-overview.md:30 c42b2c2c8ec445e5acc4941b099bdeb4
msgid ""
"**PBX / CCaaS operator**: run vanilla or a custom XML profile as an IP-PBX, "
"conference, voicemail, or call-center node; register SIP phones; route DIDs."
msgstr ""
"**PBX / CCaaS 运维人员**：以 vanilla 或自定义 XML 配置运行 IP-PBX、会议、语音信箱或呼叫中心节点；注册 SIP "
"话机；路由 DID。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:31 c0d40768dac64317a1595eedca81405b
msgid ""
"**SBC / interconnect engineer**: use the `conf/sbc` profile and Sofia SIP "
"(`mod_sofia`) to border-control SIP trunks and media."
msgstr ""
"**SBC / 互联工程师**：使用 `conf/sbc` 配置和 Sofia SIP（`mod_sofia`）对 SIP 中继和媒体做边界控制。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:32 314ab7497b424d4c85ffd42cc41cafe0
msgid ""
"**Application developer**: control calls from Lua/Python/JavaScript modules "
"or from an external process over ESL (`mod_event_socket` on TCP 8021, "
"`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`)."
msgstr ""
"**应用开发者**：通过 Lua/Python/JavaScript 模块，或经 ESL 从外部进程控制呼叫（`mod_event_socket` 监听"
" TCP 8021，`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:33 53d5c395df1249cb855ee8a4cf79b99c
msgid ""
"**WebRTC / HTML5 developer**: terminate browser sessions through Verto "
"(`mod_verto`, endpoint name `verto.rtc`)."
msgstr "**WebRTC / HTML5 开发者**：通过 Verto（`mod_verto`，终端名 `verto.rtc`）终结浏览器会话。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:34 a8b5aa9576ea470aaf564881b69c0d40
msgid ""
"**Module developer**: implement `SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION` against "
"`src/include/switch.h` and drop a `.so` into the modules directory."
msgstr ""
"**模块开发者**：对照 `src/include/switch.h` 实现 `SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`，并将 "
"`.so` 放入模块目录。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:35 d58ea5663e0e4a0287df67f0028e4d96
msgid ""
"**Packager / SRE**: build from source (`bootstrap.sh` + Autotools), Debian "
"packages (`debian/`, `scripts/packaging`), Windows (`w32/`, "
"`Freeswitch.2017.sln`), or Docker (`docker/`)."
msgstr ""
"**打包人员 / SRE**：从源码构建（`bootstrap.sh` + Autotools）、Debian "
"包（`debian/`、`scripts/packaging`）、Windows（`w32/`、`Freeswitch.2017.sln`）或 "
"Docker（`docker/`）。"

