#: ../../00-overview.md:47 525f0d7c050f46a78c00f8e874571994
msgid ""
"A directory user authenticates to a Sofia profile. After auth, that user’s "
"`user_context` selects the dialplan context. Vanilla internal profile "
"`context` is `public` (`conf/vanilla/sip_profiles/internal.xml`) and applies"
" to **unauthenticated** inbound; authenticated users 1000–1019 have "
"`user_context=default` (`conf/vanilla/directory/default/1000.xml`)."
msgstr ""
"号码簿用户向 Sofia profile 认证。认证后，该用户的 `user_context` 选择拨号计划上下文。Vanilla internal "
"profile 的 `context` 是 "
"`public`（`conf/vanilla/sip_profiles/internal.xml`），用于**未认证**入局；已认证用户 "
"1000–1019 的 "
"`user_context=default`（`conf/vanilla/directory/default/1000.xml`）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:49 5d19eb56ce91480ba2b728bbb293dac8
msgid ""
"At runtime those files are preprocessor-assembled into one XML document with"
" sections `configuration`, `dialplan`, `chatplan`, `directory`, and "
"`languages`. See [Architecture](02-architecture.md) and [Chapter "
"3](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/xml)."
msgstr ""
"运行时这些文件由预处理器组装成一份 XML 文档，包含 "
"`configuration`、`dialplan`、`chatplan`、`directory`、`languages` 各节。见 "
"[架构](02-architecture.md) 与 [第 3 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/xml)。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:51 da7abd2986a44632a335b8dd3a31f0b5
msgid "System Snapshot"
msgstr "系统快照"

#: ../../00-overview.md:53 484e9f5c2cf1447cb5132297b732b3fe
msgid ""
"**Deployment model**: single long-running `freeswitch` process per host "
"(Unix daemon or Windows service `FreeSWITCH`), plus optional sidecar apps "
"talking ESL. Not a microservice mesh. Default install prefix is "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch` (`configure.ac`)."
msgstr ""
"**部署模型**：每台主机一个长期运行的 `freeswitch` 进程（Unix 守护进程或 Windows 服务 "
"`FreeSWITCH`），外加可选的通过 ESL 通信的 sidecar 应用。不是微服务网格。默认安装前缀为 "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:54 79205d24781a4ac1afa20f234436ef1b
msgid ""
"**Core runtime shape**: threaded C core owns sessions, media, timers, and a "
"state machine; features load as DSOs from `src/mod/` categories "
"(`endpoints`, `applications`, `codecs`, `dialplans`, `event_handlers`, "
"`languages`, `xml_int`, …)."
msgstr ""
"**核心运行形态**：多线程 C 核心拥有会话、媒体、定时器和状态机；功能以 DSO 形式从 `src/mod/` "
"各类目录加载（`endpoints`、`applications`、`codecs`、`dialplans`、`event_handlers`、`languages`、`xml_int`"
" 等）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:55 62e46ab4d38649c9b6b55f492b79652e
msgid ""
"**Primary data path**: signaling (SIP/Verto/Skinny/…) → session "
"(`src/switch_core_session.c`) → XML dialplan / directory → applications "
"(bridge, conference, voicemail, …) → RTP/SRTP media (`src/switch_rtp.c`, "
"`src/switch_core_media.c`) → CDR/event consumers."
msgstr ""
"**主数据路径**：信令（SIP/Verto/Skinny/…）→ 会话（`src/switch_core_session.c`）→ XML 拨号计划 "
"/ directory → 应用（bridge、conference、voicemail 等）→ RTP/SRTP "
"媒体（`src/switch_rtp.c`、`src/switch_core_media.c`）→ CDR/事件消费者。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:56 fbabf8459d554efebf12615395f12d5e
msgid ""
"**Top risk or constraint**: real-time media and large UDP port ranges. "
"Docker docs require host networking; vanilla ESL listens on `::`:8021 with "
"password `ClueCon` (`event_socket.conf.xml`) — change bind/password before "
"any non-loopback exposure (`fs_cli` still defaults to `127.0.0.1:8021`)."
msgstr ""
"**主要风险或约束**：实时媒体和较大的 UDP 端口范围。Docker 文档要求使用 host 网络；vanilla ESL 在 `::`:8021 "
"上监听，密码为 `ClueCon`（`event_socket.conf.xml`）——在任何非 loopback "
"暴露之前务必修改绑定地址和密码（`fs_cli` 仍默认连接 `127.0.0.1:8021`）。"

