#: ../../00-overview.md:58 33eb665ca90f4ae99c8c523b7b152c4c
msgid ""
"Report vulns to `security@signalwire.com` (`SECURITY.md`). Default ESL "
"listen is loopback."
msgstr "漏洞请报告至 `security@signalwire.com`（`SECURITY.md`）。默认 ESL 监听在 loopback。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:58 784988af6ddc44848e804a938533cc87
msgid ""
"Change ESL password `ClueCon` and SIP credentials before production. MPL "
"1.1; some bundled libs use other licenses."
msgstr "上线前请修改 ESL 密码 `ClueCon` 和 SIP 凭据。MPL 1.1；部分捆绑库使用其他许可证。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:90 ba0b07dccc2b4f7ba41a974bae70f5d9
msgid "Key Project Facts"
msgstr "项目关键事实"

#: ../../00-overview.md:92 9f40237f4d1f42599833518879a7c65b
msgid ""
"**Code roots**: `src/` (core + `src/include/` public API), `src/mod/` "
"(modules), `libs/` (APR, SRTP, ESL, VPX, …), `conf/` (XML profiles), "
"`build/` (Autotools helpers, `modules.conf.in`), `debian/` / "
"`scripts/packaging/`, `w32/`, `docker/`, `tests/unit/`."
msgstr ""
"**代码根目录**：`src/`（核心 + `src/include/` 公共 "
"API）、`src/mod/`（模块）、`libs/`（APR、SRTP、ESL、VPX 等）、`conf/`（XML "
"配置）、`build/`（Autotools 辅助、`modules.conf.in`）、`debian/` / "
"`scripts/packaging/`、`w32/`、`docker/`、`tests/unit/`。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:93 ead8ada3fd72493981b945c1426e8098
msgid "**Primary interfaces**:"
msgstr "**主要接口**："

#: ../../00-overview.md:94 fa6a07a7cabb40f3b16e51d54e93fd1b
msgid "SIP: `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/` (typical 5060/5080; TLS 5061/5081)"
msgstr "SIP：`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/`（通常 5060/5080；TLS 5061/5081）"

#: ../../00-overview.md:95 ced362beab1744cab6096df6054cb18a
msgid "WebRTC/HTML5: `src/mod/endpoints/mod_verto/`"
msgstr "WebRTC/HTML5：`src/mod/endpoints/mod_verto/`"

#: ../../00-overview.md:96 af217a788c734f13adacae748c0ea7c6
msgid ""
"Event Socket: `src/mod/event_handlers/mod_event_socket/` + `libs/esl/` "
"(`fs_cli`)"
msgstr ""
"Event Socket：`src/mod/event_handlers/mod_event_socket/` + "
"`libs/esl/`（`fs_cli`）"

#: ../../00-overview.md:97 03f5fa03e8c24b5baed9a50a3fa9ea7c
msgid ""
"XML config: `conf/*/freeswitch.xml` preprocessor (`#include` / `X-PRE-"
"PROCESS`)"
msgstr "XML 配置：`conf/*/freeswitch.xml` 预处理器（`#include` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`）"

#: ../../00-overview.md:98 59c154f355e14c97a07f7235786e7d79
msgid ""
"Embedded languages: `src/mod/languages/` (Lua, Python3, V8, Perl, Java, "
"managed, …)"
msgstr "嵌入式语言：`src/mod/languages/`（Lua、Python3、V8、Perl、Java、managed 等）"

#: ../../00-overview.md:99 91418be5d0bd43ef9f8ad36bcf990959
msgid ""
"**Entry points**: `src/switch.c` (`main`), core init in `src/switch_core.c`,"
" DSO loader in `src/switch_loadable_module.c`."
msgstr ""
"**入口点**：`src/switch.c`（`main`），核心初始化在 `src/switch_core.c`，DSO 加载器在 "
"`src/switch_loadable_module.c`。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:100 6627028557404aecae81020ee23a65ef
msgid ""
"**Default modules**: uncommented lines in `build/modules.conf.in` (Sofia, "
"Verto, conference, voicemail, Opus, XML dialplan, `mod_signalwire`, …)."
msgstr ""
"**默认模块**：`build/modules.conf.in` "
"中未注释的行（Sofia、Verto、conference、voicemail、Opus、XML 拨号计划、`mod_signalwire` 等）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:101 331584141c4448c08b9a8ac4b7fd7599
msgid ""
"**CI**: GitHub Actions on `master`, `v1.10`, `v1.11` "
"(`.github/workflows/ci.yml` and related workflows for macOS, Windows, "
"tarball, scan-build)."
msgstr ""
"**CI**：GitHub Actions 运行于 "
"`master`、`v1.10`、`v1.11`（`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 以及 "
"macOS、Windows、tarball、scan-build 相关工作流）。"

